 "_comment": "Not a real Schwung module -- chain_params lists the VST parameters of vfilter_vst.cpp so mpc-vst-plugins' tools/gen_vst.py can generate params.h + the skin. Keys must match vfilter_vst.cpp. Start values the plugin sets itself (start_values()). Only append, never reorder. 0.3.0 appended the step sequencer (seq*, sv1..sv16 = vowel per step, sl1..sl16 = level per step). 0.4.0 appended the note lane (notes .. nrnd, sn1..sn16 = scale step per step, st1..st16 = rest/note/accent/slide), sent out through the plugin's own ALSA MIDI port 'V-Filter'. 0.5.0 appended FLOW (flow .. fdens): an endless generated line in a swinging corridor.",
